      "cooked": "<p>I'm playing a game in which I want to muck about with things for fun. &nbsp;To do this, I need to get out Savage Mana so I can control the villain deck, so what does the RNG do? &nbsp;It puts the two copies of SM as cards number 38 and 39 in Haka's deck. &nbsp;Thanks, RNG. &nbsp;You're super-helpful, as always.</p>",
