      "created_at": "2016-10-18T19:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"bobbertoriley\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/48/1910_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> bobbertoriley:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That seems sad in a cooperative card game. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's a solo game I'm playing. &nbsp;I'm controlling all 5 heroes in an attempt to do something silly and non-standard. &nbsp;I'd never do that with other live players.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Edit: Oh, wait. You mean that the RNG was uncooperative in a co-op game. &nbsp;Yes. I get that now. &nbsp;Apparently, I was humor-imparied.</p>",
